status: accept
exit: 42
covers: variant_clause
note: |
  The canonical named coproduct: `place Name { this > A :U B }`. A place declared
  by the arms it is the sum of (each arm a coproduct injection, a sub-object of the
  place). The name lets an arm payload refer to the type it defines, so a genuinely
  recursive type is expressible. Built with hit(Ctor, args), consumed with
  match/hit_elim; at runtime a content-addressed MerkleTree node (arm = tag,
  arguments = children), so equal subvalues share storage.
